implementationPlan.description:
Apply Dependabot PRs #237 (ws 8.22.0 -> 8.22.1) and #235 (@types/node 26.6.5 -> 26.6.6) to packages/moe-daemon, using ONLY the main session's own Edit tool. Global rail: no npm install or --package-lock-only, no git apply, no sed and no script writes into the tree. Run NO npm command in the worktree or the shared checkout: installs, builds and tests happen only in step 3's /tmp snapshot. Each old string below occurs exactly once in its file at target 9e9e7345. Change nothing else: LF endings, indentation, lockfileVersion 3 and the final newline stay as they are.
package.json: line 70 `"ws": "^8.22.0"` -> `"ws": "^8.22.1"`; line 73 `"@types/node": "^26.6.5"` -> `"@types/node": "^26.6.6"`.
package-lock.json:
(a) the same two replacements in the root packages[""] block (lines 15 and 21);
(b) under "node_modules/@types/node" (lines 840-842), replace `"version": "26.6.5",` / `"resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/@types/node/-/node-26.6.5.tgz",` / `"integrity": "sha512-uMzsv9stDdofIZBx4UGh4Z9ZgXnGC9seRDscilBcTHAeOFk67MZg/k9bWVfO+bk4qZmG+l52hRnLwUiH2LnJTg==",` with `"version": "26.6.6",` / `"resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/@types/node/-/node-26.6.6.tgz",` / `"integrity": "sha512-MzQj+8Kx3XI40OmUAE6Qoh58ZMNstNNMwn2nfd3qWsfe7nDNSqJNzes4njhz6AHwrSHOffSLwXU6yb474Q4aog==",`;
(c) under "node_modules/ws" (lines 2373-2375), replace `"version": "8.22.0",` / `"resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/ws/-/ws-8.22.0.tgz",` / `"integrity": "sha512-Ydggc987+RO0AnWtZ/7Wq9FtNvcrL1b/RO0ud9mWjUPgDrsAAwQSF51sm2hm1XofbU/4jkpGEsLFsZZxU+1DOg==",` with `"version": "8.22.1",` / `"resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/ws/-/ws-8.22.1.tgz",` / `"integrity": "sha512-oyL6OPYme/CmiFvNuGzeoxCJ4nOrZE2O1FwM9MWM1AsGri6nLXB2pg+lNA8aLeXMSav0J6eIVS1j6vUPzUtK9g==",`.
Make each three-line block ONE Edit, so that its old_string is unique. Leave engines, peerDependencies and the undici-types ~8.9.0 dependency alone: `npm view` shows those unchanged for both new versions.
Error handling: if an old string is missing or not unique (the target changed these files after planning), stop. Read `gh.exe pr diff 237` and `gh.exe pr diff 235` (read-only) and edit to exactly their + lines. Never substitute an npm-generated lockfile.
No test file changes. Epic rail 'regression tests or test updates': this task changes no source. Its regression test is the full daemon suite, which step 3 runs against the new ws.
